    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you skilfully manoeuvre the red car out of the traffic jam?</h2>Slide the vehicles blocking it in their lanes forwards and backwards \u2013 until the road ahead is clear for the red car!<br><br>Not only can you play Rush Hour\u00ae Deluxe alone, but go head-to-head with other players to measure your brainpower: who will solve the challenges in the quickest time and with the fewest moves?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With the original design of the successful board game<br></li><li>Playful logical brain training<br></li><li>60 challenges<br></li><li>5 difficulty levels<br></li><li>Play alone or locally with up to 4 players (requires up to 3 additional game controllers)<br></li><li>Great animations and effects</li></ul>",
